{
  "uid": "obs-postgres",
  "title": "PostgreSQL",
  "description": "Connexions, requêtes lentes, taille des bases, verrous. Alimenté par postgres_exporter, qui ne démarre QUE si DATA_SOURCE_NAME est fournie à la plateforme. Sans elle, ce dashboard reste vide — et c'est le comportement attendu, pas une panne.",
  "tags": [
    "socle"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 39,
      "title": "Si ce dashboard est vide",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Le job `postgres` se découvre par fichier (`prometheus/targets/postgres.yml`).\n\nIl ne devient actif que si la plateforme reçoit `DATA_SOURCE_NAME` — une chaîne de connexion vers un compte **en lecture seule** doté de `pg_monitor`. Vérifier dans Prometheus → Status → Targets que le job `postgres` est *up*."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 40,
      "title": "Connexions et activité",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 41,
      "title": "Connexions par base",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_stat_database_numbackends",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 42,
      "title": "Transaction la plus longue",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_stat_activity_max_tx_duration",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Une transaction qui dure bloque le VACUUM et fait enfler la base."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 43,
      "title": "Verrous détenus",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (mode) (pg_locks_count)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{mode}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Les verrous en mode Exclusive qui persistent sont la cause la plus fréquente d'une écriture lente."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 44,
      "title": "Volumétrie et débit",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 45,
      "title": "Taille des bases",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_database_size_bytes",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 46,
      "title": "Transactions par seconde",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(pg_stat_database_xact_commit[$__rate_interval])",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}} validées",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback[$__rate_interval])",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}} annulées",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 47,
      "title": "Taux de succès du cache",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "pg_stat_database_blks_hit / (pg_stat_database_blks_hit + pg_stat_database_blks_read)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Sous 0,99 durablement, la mémoire partagée est trop petite pour le jeu de données actif."
    }
  ]
}
